<%--
_Sys_Users_Action - the Users screen: every login identity on the install in one grid
(_Sys_Users_DataGrid, grid key "users"). A row opens the identity (_Sys_User_View_Action):
its memberships across every site, sessions, sign-ins and security state.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Users_Action>
<_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
    <Slot:main>
        <_Sys_Users_DataGrid />
    </Slot:main>
</_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
</Define:_Sys_Users_Action>
